{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52968","headline":"游枋口（幷序） 石笋高 · 郑辕","name":"游枋口（幷序） 石笋高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竦干青山下，卓立白云际。\n濯似春筠茎，奇如夏峰势。\n赏者空往来，亭亭几千里。\n（见乾隆二十四年刊萧应植纂《济源县志》卷十六）（〖1〗《县志》跋云：「郑辕以下三人，《旧志》列於明时，今改正。\n《全唐诗》旁搜博采，有郑辕，余无考。\n」〖2〗清孙星衍《寰宇访碑录》卷四着录河南济源唐代石刻有「监察御史郑辕诗，正书，无年月。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑辕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}